You don't have to read the spoiler file for the wizard mode specialities,
just use the online help. Hit ? and select the wizard mode commands. You only
get to see them when you ARE in the wizard mode.
All the wizard mode extra commands are used with control keys.
You have obviously found the ^I command, and there are at least
^W, ^E, ^T works always, ^V, ^X, ^G.. I don't remember wether there was
still more. Try the control keys, you'll see what they do.
